      "api_owner": "VkWriteDescriptorSet",
      "condition_key": "core",
      "page": "chapters/descriptorsets.html",
      "text_html": "All consecutive bindings updated via a single <code>VkWriteDescriptorSet</code> structure, except those with a <code>descriptorCount</code> of zero, <strong class=\"purple\">must</strong> all either use immutable samplers or <strong class=\"purple\">must</strong> all not use immutable samplers",
